 Governor -- spec-basis HARD check, evidence-incomplete HARD check,
 `:ur-registration-missing` HARD check independently verifying
 `:has-ur-registration?` when `:requires-ur-registration?` is true,
 `:platform-operator-fused` HARD check independently verifying a
 `:jurisdiction/assess` proposal never collapses IUB and VDAA into one
 fused authority -- the FLAGSHIP new check for this vertical, grounded
 in the regulator/operator split verified for EIS (eis.gov.lv) --,
 engagement-fee-mismatch independent recompute, `:vat-unverified` HARD
